{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2022-06-26 18:16:00', 'title': 'FEDEX AND DIRECT RELIEF DELIVER 52 TONS OF CRITICAL MEDICAL AID FOR UKRAINIANS', 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEDEX CORP. (NYSE: FDX) AND DIRECT RELIEF CONTINUE TO SUPPORT THOSE AFFECTED BY THE CONFLICT IN UKRAINE. ON SUNDAY, JUNE 26, FEDEX EXPRESS SAFELY DELIVERED 52 TONS OF CRITICAL MEDICAL AID TO POLAND FROM THE UNITED STATES VIA A FEDEX HUMANITARIAN RELIEF FLIGHT. THIS FOLLOWS FEDEX AND DIRECT RELIEF'S FIRST CHARTER FLIGHT OF AID FOR UKRAINIAN REFUGEES IN MARCH AND IS THE LATEST IN A CONTINUOUS SERIES OF SHIPMENTS FROM DIRECT RELIEF. AID ABOARD THE FEDEX EXPRESS BOE"}